WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.379 --> 00:00:02.962
(upbeat music)

00:00:36.949 --> 00:00:38.218
- [Narrator] According to the UN,

00:00:38.218 --> 00:00:39.498
Africa is one of the most vulnerable

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:41.088
continents to climate change,

00:00:41.088 --> 00:00:43.897
due to it's poverty levels,
scarce water sources,

00:00:43.897 --> 00:00:45.685
and rain-fed farmland.

00:00:45.685 --> 00:00:47.709
Farmers here in Kenya are being forced

00:00:47.709 --> 00:00:50.058
to look for new, more
drought-resistant options

00:00:50.058 --> 00:00:52.387
to grow when traditional crops fail.

00:00:52.387 --> 00:00:54.478
This is where sisal comes in.

00:00:54.478 --> 00:00:56.893
Sisal is built for harsher climates.

00:00:56.893 --> 00:00:59.559
Under it's green exterior
are strong fibers

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.038
that are useful in making
all sorts of things.

00:01:02.038 --> 00:01:04.121
There's just one problem.

00:01:46.487 --> 00:01:48.788
This was Alex's first invention.

00:01:48.788 --> 00:01:51.439
It can strip sisal fibers in seconds.

00:01:51.439 --> 00:01:54.639
These fibers can be sold
for 20 shillings per kilo.

00:01:54.639 --> 00:01:57.795
But this wasn't enough for Alex.

00:01:57.795 --> 00:02:00.486
This machine turns the fibers into rope,

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:03.945
which adds value of almost 180%.

00:02:03.945 --> 00:02:07.054
The rope can be used to
make a variety of items,

00:02:07.054 --> 00:02:08.637
like bags and mats.

00:02:44.815 --> 00:02:47.398
(upbeat music)

